# ============================================================================
# PolyNotes Secure Environment & Secret Management (.env.example)
# ============================================================================
# How Secrets Are Managed Safely:
# 1. Actual secrets live ONLY in the AI Studio Secrets Panel / gitignored .env
# 2. The Android Secrets Gradle Plugin injects variables into BuildConfig at build time
# 3. Firebase API keys in app/google-services.json are restricted to package
#    com.aistudio.polynotes.vtubtr + SHA-1 certificate and guarded by Zero-Trust
#    Firestore Security Rules (firestore.rules).
#
# GEMINI_API_KEY: Optional. Kept commented out by default so no unused key is
# packaged into the APK. Uncomment ONLY if enabling Gemini AI features via
# the AI Studio Secrets panel.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=MY_GEMINI_API_KEY
